  "steps": [
    "Mix soaked sabudana, grated boiled potato, crushed peanuts, coriander, green chillies, sendha namak, jeera, pepper until well combined.",
    "Brush a sandwich maker with very little oil and spread a thin layer in rectangular shape of the sabudana mixture.",
    "Now add the paneer slice and sprinkle sendha namak and pepper.",
    "Close it with another slice of the sabudana mixture.",
    "Toast the sandwich on low flame so that it cooks well from the inside. It will take 8-10 mins.",
    "Open the toaster when the sandwich is almost cooked and apply ghee on both sides and toast again until golden brown and crispy.",
    "Serve with green chutney and dig in!"
  ],
